{
  "slug": "easysend",
  "name": "Easysend",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Upload, share and transfer files instantly from Claude Code. Drag-drop file sharing with end-to-end encryption. No signup or API key required. Upload any file, get a shareable link in seconds. Supports multi-file bundles, encrypted uploads, direct downloads and bundle management. Free up to 1GB.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**, **1 command** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `download` (Download files from an EasySend bundle), `share` (Share files securely with encryption via EasySend), `upload` (Upload files to EasySend and get a shareable link)\n- **Commands** (1): `easysend` (Upload and share files via EasySend)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `easysend`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install easysend@claude-community` from `Easysend-co/easysend-claude-plugin`.",
